{
  "id": "747",
  "title": "I’m Sorry, Little Yu",
  "level": "elementary",
  "date": "2019-07-20",
  "synopsis": "Ben has a talk with Little Yu about how they feel about each other.",
  "audioUrl": "https://static.duchinese.net/documents/1098/96e7798365e0fdf12285ec41122d079d30112d4e.mp3?1563181731",
  "series": {
    "title": "Ben’s life in China 6: Maybe I Like Him",
    "chapter": 18,
    "totalChapters": 29
  },
  "fullText": {
    "simplified": "对不起，小雨\n\n本：小雨，你上个星期问我的话……\n小雨：你不想回答也没关系。\n本：你说的是真的吗？\n小雨：是真的。但是我知道你不想回答。\n本：不是。我那个时候不知道我想要的是什么，所以不知道怎么回答。现在我知道了。\n小雨：那你的回答是……？\n本：对不起，小雨！你很好，但是我不能和你在一起。我有喜欢的人了。\n小雨：是丽丽吧？我知道。没关系！我们还是好朋友！",
    "traditional": "對不起，小雨\n\n本：小雨，你上個星期問我的話……\n小雨：你不想回答也沒關係。\n本：你說的是真的嗎？\n小雨：是真的。但是我知道你不想回答。\n本：不是。我那個時候不知道我想要的是什麼，所以不知道怎麼回答。現在我知道了。\n小雨：那你的回答是……？\n本：對不起，小雨！你很好，但是我不能和你在一起。我有喜歡的人了。\n小雨：是麗麗吧？我知道。沒關係！我們還是好朋友！"
  },
  "sentences": [
    {
      "index": 1,
      "simplified": "\n\n",
      "traditional": "\n\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "I’m Sorry, Little Yu"
    },
    {
      "index": 2,
      "simplified": "本：小雨，你上个星期问我的话……",
      "traditional": "本：小雨，你上個星期問我的話……",
      "pinyin": "běn xiǎo yǔ nǐ shàng ge xīng qī wèn wǒ de huà",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 3,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Little Yu, about what you asked me last week…"
    },
    {
      "index": 4,
      "simplified": "小雨：你不想回答也没关系。",
      "traditional": "小雨：你不想回答也沒關係。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ nǐ bù xiǎng huí dá yě méi guān xi",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 5,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: It’s still alright if you don’t want to answer."
    },
    {
      "index": 6,
      "simplified": "本：你说的是真的吗？",
      "traditional": "本：你說的是真的嗎？",
      "pinyin": "běn nǐ shuō de shì zhēn de ma",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 7,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: Do you really mean what you said?"
    },
    {
      "index": 8,
      "simplified": "小雨：是真的。但是我知道你不想回答。",
      "traditional": "小雨：是真的。但是我知道你不想回答。",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ shì zhēn de dàn shì wǒ zhī dào nǐ bù xiǎng huí dá",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 9,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: It’s for real. But I know that you don’t want to answer."
    },
    {
      "index": 10,
      "simplified": "本：不是。我那个时候不知道我想要的是什么，所以不知道怎么回答。现在我知道了。",
      "traditional": "本：不是。我那個時候不知道我想要的是什麼，所以不知道怎麼回答。現在我知道了。",
      "pinyin": "běn bú shì wǒ nà ge shí hou bù zhī dào wǒ xiǎng yào de shì shén me suǒ yǐ bù zhī dào zěn me huí dá xiàn zài wǒ zhī dào le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 11,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: No. At that time I didn’t know what I wanted, so I didn’t know how to answer. Now I know."
    },
    {
      "index": 12,
      "simplified": "小雨：那你的回答是……？",
      "traditional": "小雨：那你的回答是……？",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ nà nǐ de huí dá shì",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 13,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: Then your answer is…?"
    },
    {
      "index": 14,
      "simplified": "本：对不起，小雨！你很好，但是我不能和你在一起。我有喜欢的人了。",
      "traditional": "本：對不起，小雨！你很好，但是我不能和你在一起。我有喜歡的人了。",
      "pinyin": "běn duì bu qǐ xiǎo yǔ nǐ hěn hǎo dàn shì wǒ bù néng hé nǐ zài yì qǐ wǒ yǒu xǐ huan de rén le",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 15,
      "simplified": "\n",
      "traditional": "\n",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Ben: I’m sorry, Little Yu! You’re very nice, but I can’t be together with you. I have someone I like."
    },
    {
      "index": 16,
      "simplified": "小雨：是丽丽吧？我知道。没关系！我们还是好朋友！",
      "traditional": "小雨：是麗麗吧？我知道。沒關係！我們還是好朋友！",
      "pinyin": "xiǎo yǔ shì lì lì ba wǒ zhī dào méi guān xi wǒ men hái shì hǎo péng you",
      "english": ""
    },
    {
      "index": 17,
      "simplified": "",
      "traditional": "",
      "pinyin": "",
      "english": "Little Yu: It’s Lili, right? I know. It’s ok! We’re still good friends!"
    }
  ],
