    "sentence_translations": [
      "I’m Sorry, Little Yu",
      "",
      "Ben: Little Yu, about what you asked me last week…",
      "",
      "Little Yu: It’s still alright if you don’t want to answer.",
      "",
      "Ben: Do you really mean what you said?",
      "",
      "Little Yu: It’s for real. But I know that you don’t want to answer.",
      "",
      "Ben: No. At that time I didn’t know what I wanted, so I didn’t know how to answer. Now I know.",
      "",
      "Little Yu: Then your answer is…?",
      "",
      "Ben: I’m sorry, Little Yu! You’re very nice, but I can’t be together with you. I have someone I like.",
      "",
      "Little Yu: It’s Lili, right? I know. It’s ok! We’re still good friends!",
      ""
    ]
